{"title":"Pirate","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 9 Pirate that attacks with slash (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"muted\">None known</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"muted\">None known</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      <p class=\"s good\">⭐ Seen as an elite 2 times (3.4% of sightings). Elites have 3× HP, hit 1.4× harder, give 3× XP and 2.5× loot.</p>\n      \n      <p class=\"s\"><b>Reagent:</b> <a href=\"#/item/pirates-windlass\">Pirates Windlass</a> <span class=\"muted\">(crafting catalyst)</span>. About 1 kill in 500, 1 in 50 from an elite. <a href=\"#/guide/reforging\">Enchanter’s Table</a></p>\n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/pirate\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/pirate?lv=9\">Lv 9 <span>40</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/pirate?lv=12\">Lv 12 <span>7</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/pirate?lv=13\">Lv 13 <span>3</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/pirate?lv=14\">Lv 14 <span>11</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/pirate?lv=15\">Lv 15 <span>4</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/pirate?lv=16\">Lv 16 <span>10</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/pirate?lv=17\">Lv 17 <span>2</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/pirate?lv=18\">Lv 18 <span>2</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/pirate?lv=19\">Lv 19 <span>3</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/pirate?lv=20\">Lv 20 <span>3</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/pirate?lv=21\">Lv 21 <span>3</span></a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/pirate?lv=22\">Lv 22 <span>2</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/pirate?lv=23\">Lv 23 <span>1</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/pirate?lv=24